{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226470","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226470","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1222647001:1":{"text":"よう。","source_cn":"早上好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5481691EBFC39BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222647002:0":{"text":"ルカさん！目が覚めたんですね！","source_cn":"卢卡！你醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CCEF3AF496E3776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222647003:1":{"text":"迷惑をかけたな。俺をここまで運ぶのは大変だっただろう？","source_cn":"麻烦你们了。把我这大块头搬回锈锚港是不是挺费劲？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x636E018C7D4158A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222647004:1":{"text":"お礼は、後ろにいる二人のお仲間さんに言ってください。","source_cn":"要谢就谢你身后的两位同伴吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85E2F18C92ADD7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222647005:1":{"text":"こいつらが俺を街まで運んだのか？","source_cn":"是他们两个把我带回来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CFAB6A8CB6CCB65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222647006:1":{"text":"へえ、若頭……お、俺たちっす。","source_cn":"嘿嘿……二当家……是我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25A7623C332BA265","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222647007:1":{"text":"それで最近腰の調子が悪そうだったのか。すまんな、重かっただろう。","source_cn":"我说你们怎么老是捶后腰，原来是累着了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53A06309E3CD1F15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222647008:1":{"text":"め、滅相もねえ！若頭はブラッディ・マリーになくてはならない存在なんだ。俺たちの腰ぐらい安いもんさ！","source_cn":"二当家！别把自己说得像是一坨肉，您可是血薇帮不可或缺的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E97DC101A8DA1FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222647009:1":{"text":"ずいぶんと謙虚だな……いつもは手柄が欲しいと騒ぐくせに。","source_cn":"你们两个……平时喜欢抢功劳，怎么这回谦虚起来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91A94B73C3F85A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222647010:1":{"text":"いやだって、運んでる最中にうっかり荷車から落として、頭をぶつけたなんて言えねえですし……","source_cn":"总不能说是因为搬运过程中不小心让您掉下马车，撞到了头……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA49AE3D2B4DFFD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222647011:1":{"text":"おまっ！馬鹿野郎！","source_cn":"闭嘴！你这笨蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA93D3CE59034810B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222647012:1":{"text":"まったく。今回は大目に見てやる。それから……","source_cn":"行了。我不会追究你们的过失。还有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF86430C745AF64B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222647013:1":{"text":"ありがとな。","source_cn":"谢谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91632399FB4AAAC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222647014:1":{"text":"若頭……！","source_cn":"……二当家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x668D4EE38246D389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222647015:1":{"text":"くううっ……やっぱ若頭は優しいっす！","source_cn":"呜呜呜……二当家真是好人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8563B62B63131C62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222647016:1":{"text":"さて、俺たちも行こう。ボスが話があるそうだ。","source_cn":"好了，别站在这里闲聊了，索尼娅有事找我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BBFF066F8B7B464","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222647017:1":{"text":"ここ数日で分かったことをまとめたらしい、ボスの所に行くぞ。","source_cn":"她将这段时间收集到的信息整理了一番，我们去找她吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB88A680F87E9A215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"ルカ","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮的阿柴":{"text":"アーチャイ","source":"血薇帮的阿柴","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮的阿吉":{"text":"アギー","source":"血薇帮的阿吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":5}}